will change as well.

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:08.310
And I have noticed, it's not

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:10.770
it's not a matter of if,
it's a matter of when.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:13.713
- [Interviewer] And what
kind of changes do you see?

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.160
- A shadiness factor.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:18.120
Like people that weren't
shady become shady

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.960
this is something I see on
a daily basis it seems like

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.740
people that weren't shady become shady

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.043
and people that are shady become shadier.

00:03:24.043 --> 00:03:25.460
- [Interviewer] Like
what? Lying, stealing?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:28.563
- Lying, stealing, and
the like, yeah, exactly.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.015
- [Interviewer] Interesting.
And where do you stay now?

00:03:33.015 --> 00:03:34.073
